== request: GET http://localhost/
listener: 127.0.0.1:8080
server: tests/config-corpus/crossplane-simple/nginx.conf:9 [server_name default_server] — the first server block wins — server_name/Host selection is parse-only at this pin (a named delta)
location: / (tests/config-corpus/crossplane-simple/nginx.conf:12)
  precedence: = exact > longest prefix (regex is parse-only at this pin and never wins)
  candidate location / (tests/config-corpus/crossplane-simple/nginx.conf:12) — won: the longest matching prefix wins (1 bytes)
effective directives (the winning chain, with provenance):
  listen       127.0.0.1:8080;  # from tests/config-corpus/crossplane-simple/nginx.conf:10
  server_name  default_server;  # from tests/config-corpus/crossplane-simple/nginx.conf:11
  return 200 "foo bar baz";  # from tests/config-corpus/crossplane-simple/nginx.conf:13
